#: ../../source/object-is_README.md:10
msgid ""
"ES2015-compliant shim for Object.is - differentiates between -0 and +0, "
"and can compare to NaN."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/object-is_README.md:12
msgid ""
"Essentially, Object.is returns the same value as === - but true for NaN, "
"and false for -0 and +0."
msgstr ""

